# Token economy

- Reply short. No summaries, recaps, or “what I did next”.
- Touch only files needed for the ask. No exploratory sweeps.
- Prefer targeted search over reading whole files.
- One feature = one chat when possible; don’t reload unrelated history into work.
- Don’t create docs/todos/extra files unless asked.
